sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  Student->>API: POST booking (slotId)
  API->>DB: Find student and slot
  API->>DB: Check existing booking
  API->>DB: Atomic increment if booked < seats
  alt seat available
    DB-->>API: Updated slot
    API->>DB: Insert booking
    API-->>Student: 201 Created
    API-->>Student: Socket update to room boards
  else slot full
    DB-->>API: No slot updated
    API-->>Student: 409 SLOT_FULL
  end
